2. Write a sample program to handle exceptions.

public class Except {

	public static void main(String[] args) {

		try {
			int a =17;
			int b =a/0;
			System.out.println(b);
			
		}catch(Exception ae){
			System.out.println("After exception handling");
			
		} finally{
			int c =17-20;
			System.out.println("From finally block:"+ c);
		}
	}

}
Output : 
After exception handling
From finally block:-3
